      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "죄송해요, 조금만 이러고 있을게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Sorry, just let me stay like this a little.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "211d1734-cb5f-5d15-9fbf-b4299e6843ae",
      "type": "Comment",
